      "flags": {},
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>If the pengkin is Prone, it can slide across flat surfaces instead of crawling and has a Speed of 35 feet while doing so. If the pengkin gives itself the Prone condition voluntarily, it can right itself and end the condition without expending any movement.</p>",
