        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Ability:</strong> Charisma; <strong>DC:</strong> 15; <strong>Modifier:</strong> +7. The pengkin is an innate spellcaster and doesn't require Material components.</p><p><strong>At Will:</strong> <em>Mage Hand</em>, <em>Minor Illusion</em>, <em>Ray of Frost</em> (level 5 caster)</p><p><strong>4/Day:</strong> <em>Brainfreeze</em>*, <em>Coldsnap</em>*, <em>Detect Thoughts</em> (C)</p><p><strong>1/Day Each:</strong> <em>Black Tentacles</em> (C), <em>Dream</em></p><p>*See the spell pages of the Field Notes PDF; (C) indicates Concentration.</p>",
